      "en": "Arrangements for measuring currents or voltages or for indicating presence or sign thereof (G01R5/00 takes precedence; for measuring bioelectric currents or voltages A61B5/24)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> Within groups G01R19/02&#160;-&#160;G01R19/32, group G01R19/28 takes precedence. Groups G01R19/18&#160;-&#160;G01R19/257 take precedence over groups G01R19/02&#160;-&#160;G01R19/17 and G01R19/30. ",
