      "en": "Arrangements for testing, measuring or monitoring the electrical condition of accumulators or electric batteries, e.g. capacity or state of charge [SoC]<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This group covers arrangements for measuring, testing or indicating electrical conditions or variables of accumulators or electric batteries. Arrangements for monitoring, measuring, testing or indicating condition structurally associated with the battery are covered by H01M, e.g. by group H01M10/48",
